{"2229370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Titan Force", "steam_appid": 2229370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Titan Force</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world has fallen. Cities lie in ruins, overrun by a relentless horde born from a failed experiment. Humanity’s last hope is the Titans colossal war machines from a forgotten age, brought back online to fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the Titan forge facility, Commander Maya Strickland and her Titan, <strong>Aegis Prime</strong>, lead the last resistance. Climb into the cockpit. Bring a Titan back online. Turn extinction into vengeance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot a Colossal Titan; </strong>Command across ruined cities, wastelands, and open skies. Fight on the ground or take to the air in high-speed aerial dogfights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch Perspectives; Your Way</strong> Play in fast, arcade-style first-person or tactical third person. Toggle anytime with a keypress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk It to Reap It;</strong> Scavenge resources, buy weapons from the shop, and craft outposts to restore your Titan. Extract safely and keep your loot but die out there, and you lose everything you’re carrying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World That Fights Back;</strong> The undead horde adapts to your tactics. Stay sharp, stay moving, or get overrun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229370/extras/f044a8a6104dc2d4d3a56d1f25edcdc1.poster.avif?t=1785617422\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229370/extras/f044a8a6104dc2d4d3a56d1f25edcdc1.webm?t=1785617422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229370/extras/f044a8a6104dc2d4d3a56d1f25edcdc1.mp4?t=1785617422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titan Force launches into Early Access as a <strong>single-player experience</strong>. Future updates will expand gameplay, but for now, the fight is yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229370/extras/c0884d03031069711602ef2afb0e3ce6.poster.avif?t=1785617422\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229370/extras/c0884d03031069711602ef2afb0e3ce6.webm?t=1785617422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229370/extras/c0884d03031069711602ef2afb0e3ce6.mp4?t=1785617422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will You Rise?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you rise as a Titan, or be consumed by the horde? Wishlist <strong>Titan Force</strong> now and join the fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229370/extras/f2af63e5a3326f82452d874b8997af36.poster.avif?t=1785617422\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229370/extras/f2af63e5a3326f82452d874b8997af36.webm?t=1785617422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.